  message: "Measured sizing (WI-misod A/B after arm, 23 corpus repos under 200 MB, 2026-10-01; file ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_09302026/misod/unresolved_shapes.txt): unresolved sites by identifier shape -- event-sourcing 981 (544 dotted, 352 bare lower/camel, 85 bare UPPER), IPC 36 (10 dotted, 23 lower/camel, 3 UPPER), message-queue 193 (43 dotted, 150 lower/camel, 0 UPPER). Only 21 sites resolved as same-file constants (all 21 hand-checked correct). Bare UPPER names (88) are the likeliest imported constants (shape 1 of this item); many dotted ES sites are NOT string stand-ins at all (vscode `part.onWillDispose`, `Event.filter` -- event objects), and many lower/camel MQ sites are a separate false positive (WI-darom-rujil-kasal-fazod-damag-sipin-rohak-rugol: Svelte/RxJS `.subscribe(param => ...)`). Not measured: how many of the 88 UPPER names an import-following resolver would actually resolve."  # 072d
