  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: kafka producer.send(ORDERS_TOPIC) with the constant imported from settings.py, send(Topics.ORDERS) and a function-local LOCAL = 'orders' all yield publishers with topic None, and none joins the 'orders' subscriber. _name_args.py unchanged since eb0c86b990 (WI-luhod's constant resolution is websocket/HTTP only). All three shapes reproduce. MECHANISM: _name_args.ConstantResolver resolves only same-file module-scope string constants; no import following, no Class.ATTR, no function-local. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-darom."  # b143
